  "description": "FX option version of the Intrag Option instruction file, fed by New Deals · Opt FXO. Seven columns are overridden — the quote comes from SISBACEN instead of the commodity exchange.",
  "file_name_rule": "Intrag-Option-AAAAMMDD.txt, written by the Send File button of the Intrag · Option page into I:\\Confirmation\\Derivativos\\OTC Tracker\\Intrag\\AAAA\\mm. Mmmm\\dd; an existing name gets a \" (n)\" copy suffix.",
  "notes": "The Intrag Option file has NO header line: each selected row of the Intrag · Option grid becomes one ';'-delimited line, in the column order above, and the rows are grouped by Registration Date — one file per date. This registry documents the layout and its two versions; the values are written when the New Deals deal reaches Success and the counterparty is Banco J.P. Morgan (routes._save_intrag_opt_entry, with is_fxo=True for the FX option), and the row can still be edited on the grid before it is sent (maker/checker). The FX version overrides SEVEN columns — SISBACEN Currency Code, Currency Symbol, Information Source, Bulletin, Bulletin Time, Exchange and Ticker; everything else is filled the same way for both.",
  "base_key": "intrag-option",
  "le_pair": "",
  "variant_label": "Opt FXO",
  "file_name": "",
  "file_type": "delimited",
  "separator": ";",
  "record_length": null,
